OL,3,GNEWSARow over AI caricatures of
OL,4,AHillingdon councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA west London councillor has called for
OL,7,Fstronger protections for elected
OL,8,Fofficials after AI-generated
OL,9,Fcaricatures depicting her were posted
OL,10,Fon social media by the local
OL,11,FConservative Party.
OL,13,FSital Punja, a Labour member of
OL,14,FTory-controlled Hillingdon Council,
OL,15,Fsaid the images using AI to manipulate
OL,16,Fher likeness contained "racist and
OL,17,Fantisemitic tropes".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
