OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSARow over AI caricatures of
OL,4,AHillingdon councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne cartoon image posted by the
OL,7,FHillingdon Conservatives on X showed
OL,8,FPunja, who is of Indian descent,
OL,9,Fcontrolling white male counterparts as
OL,10,Fpuppets.
OL,12,FThe Hillingdon Conservative Group
OL,13,Frejected the allegations, stating that
OL,14,Fthe images were intended strictly as
OL,15,F"political satire", and denied any
OL,16,Fracist or antisemitic intent.
